<h2>Edit a holding from its detail page</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Edit button where you expect it.</strong> Open any position from a portfolio and there's now a pencil in the header — tap it to edit shares, price, date, or leverage. Previously editing was only reachable by right-clicking the row, so it was easy to miss.</li>
</ul>
